{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>They sank</b> — this is the praise." "<b>In the pit</b> — like בשחתם נתפש (they were caught in the pit they made)." "<b>This net</b> — in my opinion: for זו is like אלה, and similarly עם זו יצרתי לי, זו חטאנו לו, אלה אומרים חטאנו." "And the sense of ברשת: which these hid." "And some say: זו is like זאת."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:46.007367389Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}